  "details": "If a VRCEnablePersistence misses VRCPlayerObject, the component editor shows an error. (See the attached. It is fine)\n\nHowever, building and uploading the world is possible, and no warnings or errors appear in either the Validations section of the SDK Builder tab or Unity Console.\n\nI suggest warning it in the Validations section, which would be more friendly for creators.\n\nSDK version: 3.7.2-persistence-beta.1\n\n(I wrote this in the closed beta [CRE-1594]. I am reposting here to share)",
